         fhir:value [
           a fhir:markdown ;
           fhir:v "**ITI-YY2 VHL Receiver Initiator Expected Actions** – Verifies that the VHL Receiver correctly\nconstructs retrieval requests, validates and caches returned DID Documents, maps public keys to\nintended uses, tracks expiry, handles revocation notifications, and processes error responses.\nSource: sections 2:3.YY2.4.1, 2:3.YY2.4.2.3, and 2:3.YY2.5."
